doc:Factsabstract_1_1 schema:text "In this study, a comprehensive mathematical method for modeling the operational reliability of mine hoisting equipment under conditions of incomplete and heavily censored data is developed." .
_:f5b3695980d081f9a824d156bf09182b rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsabstract_1_1 schema:text "In this study, a comprehensive mathematical method for modeling the operational reliability of mine hoisting equipment under conditions of incomplete and heavily censored data is developed." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:816f9b606a42 .
doc:Factsabstract_1_1 schema:text "Considering right, left, and interval censoring, the paper proposes a unified statistical procedure that combines empirical estimation of failure rates with parametric identification using Weibull, exponential, normal, and lognormal distributions." .
_:dd03b57f55a89be70457bf37120d782f rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsabstract_1_1 schema:text "Considering right, left, and interval censoring, the paper proposes a unified statistical procedure that combines empirical estimation of failure rates with parametric identification using Weibull, exponential, normal, and lognormal distributions." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:816f9b606a42 .
